  "details": "Description\n\nCan no longer reposition menus by dragging with the trigger. This behavior was useful and now is gone, with no clear replacement for moving the menu. Personally I think it'd be even better if the menu simply spawned at whatever angle you're looking at in the first place, but being able to drag the menu to wherever you want should be restored regardless.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nHold trigger on the top bar of the menu and move controller as if to drag the menu, and nothing will happen(whereas it previously would move with your cursor). There is no workaround I am aware of.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: Quest 2)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
